Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:04.32,Sub,Every Habesha mom has a hidden superpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:09.83,Sub,My daughter, bring me my bag from the bedroom table.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:19.49,Sub,I went in. Not on the table. Under the bed, in the wardrobe... I searched everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:24.59,Sub,Mom! It's not here! I can't find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:31.77,Sub,What?! It's not there?! If I come in there and find it... I'm kicking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:39.53,Sub,Mom walked in. It didn't take her one second. It was on the bed, right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:44.28,Sub,Here it is! What is this?! Where are your eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:53.94,Sub,Another day, Mom was busy making wot. I cleaned the house and came with the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.01,Sub,Mom, where should I put the trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:01.22,Sub,Put it on my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:10.18,Sub,Habesha moms find everything, and have an answer for everything. For my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:15.00,Card,Made with AI\Nለእናቶቻችን
